flowchart TD
  Demand[Existing construction material demand] --> Plan[Plan real packages in same connected warehouse]
  Plan --> Claims[Atomic per-package Ledger claims / one actual hauler and truck]
  Claims --> Curb[Drive to valid exterior portal curb]
  Curb --> Face[Acquire actual shelf service face]
  Face --> Pickup[Actual <=25kg worker pickup under that package claim]
  Pickup --> Release[Release source face / carry to same truck]
  Release --> Loaded[Actual truck deposit / close that package claim]
  Loaded -->|more claimed packages| Face
  Loaded -->|trip batch loaded| Deliver[Existing drive / physical site unload / return]
  Cancel[Cancellation / safe reassignment / recovery] --> Unclaimed[Release all uncollected package claims]
  Unclaimed --> Retain[Existing owner retains actual carried/onboard goods]
  Space[Actual warehouse access/geometry event] --> Face
  Space --> Repath[Replan only changed real walking geometry]
  Fuel[Existing refuel request / explicit1..20kg warehouse can limit] --> Source[Reserve real fuel and actual shelf service point]
  Source --> Carry[Real pickup / release source face / carry to same hull]
  Carry --> Tank[Existing exact tank deposit / no kg-litre conversion]
